		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Short, green plant people the size of goblins, wielding crude spears. Spawned from victims of russet mold spores.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 1, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 spear (close/near) -1 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 0</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Inoculated</strong>. Embedded with russet mold. When slain, explodes in near-sized cube centered on vegepygmy. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON and spawn 1d6 vegepygmies.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
